<ul>
<li data-source-range="136:138">Prices are for a Tuesday. Ask the fixer on a Friday.</li>
</ul>
</div><div class="section dc-section-panel dc-section-lore" data-section="lore" data-name="the-lower-monoverse" data-source-range="140:141"><h2 data-name="the-lower-monoverse">The Lower Monoverse</h2>
<p>Where the city keeps what it would rather forget: dripping pipework, dead billboards, and neighbours who still wave.</p>
</div><div class="section dc-section-panel dc-section-dm" data-section="dm" data-name="running-a-chase" data-source-range="148:149"><h2 data-name="running-a-chase">Running a Chase</h2>
<p>Keep the pressure on. Let the dice say who gets away, and let the city complicate it.</p>
</div><div class="section dc-section-panel dc-section-choose" data-section="choose" data-name="pick-a-quirk" data-source-range="156:157"><h2 data-name="pick-a-quirk">Pick a Quirk</h2>
<ul>
<li data-source-range="160:161">Hums when nervous.</li>
