</div>
<p>A roll table is the same thing with a <code>Roll</code> column:</p>
<div class="dg-stage">
<table>
<thead data-source-range="978:979">
<tr data-source-range="978:979">
<th>Roll</th>
<th>Encounter</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody data-source-range="980:984">
<tr data-source-range="980:981">
<td>1–4</td>
<td>A patchhead swarm picks a fight over nothing</td>
</tr>
<tr data-source-range="981:982">
