<p><strong>Bloodlust:</strong> Patchheads add 1 to their Damage whenever they hit a creature that is missing Hit Points.</p>
<h4 data-name="grease-monkey">Grease Monkey</h4>
<blockquote>
<p data-source-range="1102:1103">Hold still, this’ll only sting a lot.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>3 HP — 1 Damage
Fodder — Medium</p>
<h5 data-name="traits-3">Traits</h5>
<p><strong>Quick Fix:</strong> A Grease Monkey patches an ally for 1 HP once per scene.</p>
</div></div></div>
<p>Tokens: <code>--dc-npc-stat-label-color</code>, <code>--dc-npc-stat-primary</code>, <code>--dc-npc-stat-secondary</code>, <code>--dc-npc-stat-rule</code>, <code>--dc-npc-stat-rule-width</code>.</p>
<h3 data-name="compact-a-small-creature-a-companion-a-drone">Compact: a small creature, a companion, a drone</h3>
<p><code>@npc-stat compact</code> is the same entry, packed: no panel, a framed box, a small name, and the two stat lines drawn as chips side by side. Use it for the small ones, in a run or in <code>@columns 2</code>.</p>
<pre><code data-source-range="1123:1140" class="language-markdown">@npc-stat compact

#### Beacon Bug

&gt; A thumb-sized surveillance drone made of living glass.

1 HP — 1 Damage

Fodder — Tiny

##### Traits

**Climb, Jump, Invisible.** Unless it moves, your eyes slide right past it.

@end-npc-stat
</code></pre>
<p class="dg-result">Result</p>
<div class="dg-stage">
<div class="section dc-section-panel dc-npc-stat dc-npc-compact" data-npc-stat="compact" data-name="beacon-bug" data-source-range="1145:1146"><h4 data-name="beacon-bug">Beacon Bug</h4>
<blockquote>
<p data-source-range="1149:1150">A thumb-sized surveillance drone made of living glass.</p>
