<p>Tokens: <code>--dc-stat-strip-accent</code> (frame and label band), <code>--dc-stat-strip-value</code> (the big numbers).</p>
<h2 data-name="stat-grid-and-at-a-glance-cards">Stat grid and at-a-glance cards</h2>
<p>Two raw-HTML forms for numbers at a glance. The four-cell stat grid takes combat stats (HP / DEF / AP / DMG) for a creature or social stats (REP / HEAT / FEE / TURN) for a contact; the at-a-glance row is one reversed label band over one big value per tile, with an ink frame and a hard shadow. Tokens for the tile: <code>--dc-at-a-glance-accent</code> (frame and label band), <code>--dc-at-a-glance-value</code>.</p>
<pre><code data-source-range="1193:1216" class="language-markdown">&lt;div class=&quot;dc-stat dc-flush&quot;&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;dc-stat-head&quot;&gt;
