<div class="dc-stickers"><span class="dc-sticker"><span class="dc-sticker-ref">1</span>Punishing Counter</span><span class="dc-arrow">»</span>⁠<span class="dc-sticker"><span class="dc-sticker-ref">2</span>Rage Hit</span></div>
<p><strong>Backbiter Spines:</strong> Reactive spine rigs in the forearms and shins. Spend an action defending and the rig braces, resisting 2 damage from melee and dealing 1 to everything in reach.</p>
</div>
